  (text "ESP32-S3 verifies local signed policy, firmware digest and gateway state before release.\\nATECC608C stores non-exportable identity key and signs grant/attestation envelopes.\\nRoot on the protected server cannot reach this trust boundary except through network policy requests." (at 20.32 22.86 0)
